  "question": {
    "text": "Value of $\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{a^{\\sin x}-1}{\\sin x}$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\log \\mathrm{a}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\sin x$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\log (\\sin x)$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\cos x$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{a^{\\sin x}-1}{\\sin x}=\\lim _{y \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{a^{y}-1}{y}$ $=\\log \\mathrm{a}$, where $\\mathrm{y}=\\sin \\mathrm{x}$\r\n\r\n$\\because \\mathrm{x} \\rightarrow 0 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y}=\\sin \\mathrm{x} \\rightarrow 0$"
  }
}